cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WAVES, please cite it as below."
title: "WAVES: A Ground-Truth Dataset of Security Weaknesses in GitHub Actions Workflows"
type: dataset
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: CC-BY-4.0
# TODO (after the anonymous review): add repository-code and the real author list and affiliations.
authors:
  - family-names: "<AUTHOR>"
    given-names: "<AUTHOR>"
abstract: >-
  WAVES is a ground-truth dataset of security weaknesses in GitHub Actions
  workflows: 475 workflows (465 real-world, 10 synthetic) manually labeled
  against the ten-weakness classification of Fares et al. with evidence-linked,
  multi-label annotations.
keywords:
  - GitHub Actions
  - software supply chain security
  - ground truth
  - benchmark
